<content>

<pre id="sch-inc-pre" guid="_80cd1d8f-f5df-4e71-8f72-638ca14297ca">
<block><txt break.before="1">AGREEMENT made the eleventh day of February One
thousand nine hundred and sixty-six BETWEEN THE COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA (in
this Agreement called &#8220;<defterm id="sch-inc-def.theCommonwealth"
guid="_fc62264c-b55b-4240-be8b-c3e7ac85982e" type="definition">the
Commonwealth</defterm>&#8221;) of the first part, THE STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES
of the second part, THE STATE OF VICTORIA of the third part, THE STATE OF
QUEENSLAND of the fourth part, THE STATE OF SOUTH AUSTRALIA of the fifth part,
THE STATE OF WESTERN AUSTRALIA of the sixth part and THE STATE OF TASMANIA of
the seventh part, each of the parties of the second, third, fourth, fifth,
sixth and seventh parts being in this Agreement referred to as a
&#8220;<defterm id="sch-inc-def.State"
guid="_adffa611-a085-4b28-b8f9-b8f2e27a11c5"
type="definition">State</defterm>&#8221; and the expression &#8220;<defterm
id="sch-inc-def.theStates" guid="_1c753703-cf54-4223-9397-063ab9615fb3"
type="definition">the States</defterm>&#8221; in this Agreement meaning, where
the context so permits or requires, all of those parties.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">WHEREAS an Agreement was made on the twelfth day
of December, One thousand nine hundred and twenty-seven, between the parties
to this Agreement with respect to the public debts of the
States:</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">AND WHEREAS that Agreement has been varied by the
following Agreements made pursuant to section 105A of the <legref jurisd="CTH"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Constitution of the
Commonwealth</name></legref> between the parties to this Agreement, namely, an
Agreement made the third day of July, One thousand nine hundred and
thirty-four, a copy of which is set forth in the Schedule to the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Soldier Settlement
Loans (Financial Agreement) Act 1935</name></legref> of the Commonwealth, and
an Agreement made the fifteenth day of November, One thousand nine hundred and
forty-four, a copy of which is set forth in the Schedule to the <legref
jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-1944-029" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Financial Agreement Act 1944</name></legref>, which Agreements
are in this Agreement referred to as &#8220;<defterm
id="sch-inc-def.theamendingAgreements"
guid="_685b771f-e403-4450-93dc-5f7c8b8cc5bf" type="definition">the amending
Agreements</defterm>&#8221;:</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">AND WHEREAS the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Currency Act 1965</name></legref> of the
Commonwealth provides for the introduction of a system of currency in which
the denominations of moneys are to be the dollar and the cent:</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1">NOW IT IS HEREBY AGREED as
follows:</txt></block></pre>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.1." guid="_562b281a-352c-4837-bd2c-6332c3942a38"
type="clause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0" id="sch-inc-t1.1.-hd"
guid="_614b876e-7042-4382-aa8e-0e3049650ce5">
<no>1.</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Agreement shall come into force on the
fourteenth day of February, One thousand nine hundred and sixty-six, being the
date on which section 8 of the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Currency Act 1965</name></legref> of the
Commonwealth is to come into operation.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.2." guid="_1c573f1a-ed6a-476d-90c5-a02374819882"
type="clause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0" id="sch-inc-t1.2.-hd"
guid="_b83e000f-aa82-4751-b89b-fc2177678fb7">
<no>2.</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Agreement, &#8220;<defterm
id="sch-inc-def.theFinancialAgreement"
guid="_323addc3-3b0f-4c9f-9ea1-ef9e73f00fd4" type="definition">the Financial
Agreement</defterm>&#8221; means the Agreement made on the twelfth day of
December, One thousand nine hundred and twenty-seven, between the parties to
this Agreement, as varied by the amending Agreements.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.3." guid="_ccb088e8-fbcf-489d-86f9-feb0bbdd8098"
type="clause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0" id="sch-inc-t1.3.-hd"
guid="_31693cf1-9260-4c25-bdde-17080c4d2077">
<no>3.</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Financial Agreement is amended as set out in
the Schedule to this Agreement.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4." guid="_f94a10a8-6f6f-492e-bbf6-04240babe2df"
type="clause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0" id="sch-inc-t1.4.-hd"
guid="_ae28f08e-b9d0-497c-8005-aa6bebab21c6">
<no>4.</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Financial Agreement is further amended by
adding after clause 17 the following clause:</txt>
<fragment format="fromcontext" style="indent">

<level id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1"
guid="_75491b82-3e29-4472-a5ef-91b38d44fe52">
<head align="center" break.before.heading="0" id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-hd"
guid="_e8673d3b-cbe2-453f-8709-7274e39740e2"><heading
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-hd-he"
guid="_890b8b8f-291b-4f96-9efb-ed4621c33704">&#8220;DECIMAL
CURRENCY.</heading></head>

<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.-"
guid="_d0e7d026-cff0-4427-95a3-e8ed5e720bc1" type="clause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0"
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--hd"
guid="_7d76cbec-1bb5-4867-91fa-3a6e08b6aacb">
<no>&#8220;18.&#8212;</no></head>

<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.1."
guid="_4cdf136f-10ca-47c6-af04-ebd64ab957ef" type="subclause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0"
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.1.-hd"
guid="_8bc97bb8-47aa-41cc-bb7e-54b3adc8605f">
<no>(1.)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference to an amount of money stated in this
Agreement in the currency provided for by the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Coinage Act
1909&#8211;1947</name></legref> of the Commonwealth that is immediately
followed in parenthesis by a reference to an amount of money in the currency
provided for by the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Currency Act 1965</name></legref> of the Commonwealth shall, for
the purposes of the operation of this Agreement on and after 14th February
1966, be read as a reference to the amount of money stated in the currency
provided for by the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Currency Act 1965</name></legref> of the Commonwealth
immediately so following.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.2."
guid="_e080a320-62c1-48dc-80b4-36cd2fd3b5bc" type="subclause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0"
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.2.-hd"
guid="_b1d19365-084d-4d7c-8e6e-34d18ba1510c">
<no>&#8220;(2.)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In relation to the references in sub-clauses (5.)
and (6.) of clause 12 of this Agreement to &#8216;&#163;100 ($200)&#8217;,
sub-clause (1.) of this clause applies only in relation to new loans raised by
a State or by the Commonwealth for and on behalf of a State on or after 14th
February 1966.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.3."
guid="_b542d32e-73d6-4ba2-8819-22768f002d15" type="subclause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0"
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.3.-hd"
guid="_34d74c89-fb70-4b68-9218-da5df1c9a147">
<no>&#8220; (3.)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of the operation of sub-clause
(10.) of clause 3 and sub-clause (21.) of clause 12 of this Agreement on and
after 14th February 1966, the equivalent in the currency provided for by the
<legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Currency
Act 1965</name></legref> of the Commonwealth of One pound in the currency
provided for by the <legref jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="no">Coinage Act 1909&#8211;1947</name></legref> of the Commonwealth
is Two dollars, the like equivalent of One shilling is Ten cents and the like
equivalent of One penny is Five-sixths of a cent.</txt></block></tier>


<tier id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.4."
guid="_209b3aa5-4307-48d0-a9e0-dec3f6524ed0" type="subclause">
<head align="left" break.before.heading="0"
id="sch-inc-t1.4.-frag-l1-t2.18.--t3.4.-hd"
guid="_1728dbba-a061-4c18-b3f6-4d9f96824249">
<no>&#8220;(4.)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference in this clause to the <legref
jurisd="CTH" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="no">Currency Act
1965</name></legref> of the Commonwealth includes a reference to that Act as
amended by any other Act of the Parliament of the
Commonwealth.&#8221;.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>
</level>
</fragment>
</block></tier>
</content>


